MID_Map_Area_Temple_Lower: 아랫순롓길
MID_Map_Area_Temple_Upper: 윗순롓길
MID_Map_Area_Port: 항구
MID_Map_Area_Stable: 축사 앞 통로
MID_Map_Area_Slums: 빈민가
